OL,3,AFour grizzly bears killed in Canada
OL,4,Aafter fatal attack on mother and
OL,5,Adaughter
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour grizzly bears have been killed in
OL,8,Fconnection with a fatal attack on a
OL,9,Fmother and daughter in the Canadian
OL,10,Fprovince of British Columbia.
OL,12,FJennifer Balcarras, 48, and her
OL,13,Fdaughter Selah Reed, 20, died earlier
OL,14,Fthis month after going on an afternoon
OL,15,Fwalk in a trail area in Bella Coola.
OL,17,FThe British Columbia Conservation
OL,18,FOffice Service (BCCOS) launched an
OL,19,Finvestigation into their deaths and
OL,20,Fforensic testing has since confirmed a
OL,21,Fsow and her three cubs were responsible
OL,22,Ffor the attack.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
